              "China's economic growth slows down to 6.5 percent in the third quarter as trade frictions with the US take their toll.\n\nEconomy|Business and Economy",
              "# China’s economic growth hits nine-year low\n*China’s economic growth slows down to 6.5 percent in the third quarter as trade frictions with the US take their toll.*\nShare\nSave",
